      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Chan Chan is one of the most powerful beings in the universe. He is an
    eccentric mad wizard with enormous power. For him,the whole cosmos is a game,
    and life is just a fragile temporary force. He created D.I.E.N.A.M.O. for generating
    unlimited energy for his every day needs (like his coffe maker, toaster etc.).
    But how does it work? It kidnaps the best warriors of any kind from all around
    the universe and puts them on a never ending fighting tournament, where each
    battle's intensity is transformed into energy. In the end, the tournament has
    only one winner. Its maker, Chan Chan...
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
